WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.050
This kid,
he's a basketball phenom.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.090
But they'll be asking,
can this grown man

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.445
play at the next level?

00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:10.140
We're all trying to understand
each other using the game

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.760
of basketball as the backdrop.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.816
[YELLING]

00:00:13.816 --> 00:00:14.616
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:14.616 --> 00:00:18.090
(SINGING) Why my
opposition always mad at me.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.910
Go get you a crowd
if you as bad as me.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:20.710
I'm a kid.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.090
The kids got a lot bigger.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.142
They're a lot bigger, a
lot faster, a lot stronger.

00:00:27.142 --> 00:00:28.100
A lot of new stories.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.850
There's a lot of new journeys.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.942
Same old Jace, always
trying to control things.

00:00:32.942 --> 00:00:34.650
We see them in their
senior year, where

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.690
they're really
feeling this urgency

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.460
to just figure out their life.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.050
You taught me
to respect women.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.270
I taught you to
use common sense.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.940
You're going to see Jace
coming into his own as a man.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.396
Plus, I got a car.

00:00:46.396 --> 00:00:47.196
[BRAKES SCREECHING]

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:48.010
(SINGING)
Everything will win.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.315
Everything will win.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.420
I am the athletic director
at Cedar Cove Academy.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:56.590
Emery comes in and just
challenges Ike's perspective,

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.450
challenges all of
our characters.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:04.557
Is democracy a
destination or a journey?

00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:06.380
Jace is
acting as a grown man,

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:10.770
so Jenna is trying to find
her peace in the storm.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.570
Oh.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.247
You ain't making any babies.

00:01:13.247 --> 00:01:15.080
(SINGING)
When you're on the top,

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.413
they're going to blame the sins.

00:01:16.413 --> 00:01:18.800
Well, the blessings going to
start when the hate it ends.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.900
It's covering the politics
of what's happening--

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.798
You think winning
state attracts donations?

00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:25.224
What do you think winning a high
school national championship

00:01:25.224 --> 00:01:26.026
would attract?

00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:28.010
 --and then also between
fathers and mothers

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.090
and daughters and sons.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.220
Since you've been
out of jail, I'm happy.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.178
I can't lose you again.

00:01:32.178 --> 00:01:34.595
I'm not through miss if she's
still sleeping in our bed.

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:36.440
It's not my fault
we made a cuteass baby

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.708
that thinks I'm cozy.

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:40.250
VOICEOVER: (SINGING) Put me in
position when I pay the price.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.010
Peter Pan dreams come from
fighting through the sacrifice.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:45.533
This season
is your last hurrah.

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:46.700
So let's go out with a bang.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.002
(SINGING)
Everybody's so sinful now.

00:01:48.002 --> 00:01:49.870
But you ain't got no know-how.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.070
The
basketball's authentic.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:52.820
You see somebody
dunking, they're dunking.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.722
They're not jumping
off of a trampoline.

00:01:54.722 --> 00:01:56.430
(SINGING)
Everything will win.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:58.490
Everything will win.

00:01:58.490 --> 00:01:59.690
One, two, three.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:00.492
[YELLS]

00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:01.950
(SINGING)
We never quit.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.210
We never fail.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.460
I want you to remember this.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:07.220
Winners are made on the court.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.919
Champions are made
off the court.

00:02:09.919 --> 00:02:13.130
The issues that they deal
with are just real adult issues.

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:16.702
You got D-1, college, all
this shit going for you.

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.660
We can't be getting caught
up in all dumb shit.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.270
This season, it's really
important to know that even

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.555
when things get
hard, to not give up.

00:02:23.555 --> 00:02:24.930
I'm told you might
have knowledge

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.160
about who attacked Joe Ward.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.370
I never thought I'd be going
through this with you, Jace.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.770
Not like this.

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.150
We've got new characters.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.460
We've got new players as well.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.710
For me, it was probably
one of the most special jobs

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:39.025
I've had my career.

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:41.410
You guys have a hell of
a season coming at you.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.810
Get ready.
(SINGING) I'm a king.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.310
Oh oh oh oh oh.
King.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.210
Oh oh oh oh oh.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.060
But I'm a king.

